I completed the search on Apartments.com with all requested filters applied: New York, NY • 3+ Beds • 2+ Baths • $1,500–$2,500 • Home Type: Condos (and Entire Place).

The site returned exactly **1 rental** matching those criteria.

ANSWER: {"answer": "Searched Apartments.com with filters: New York, NY; 3+ bedrooms; 2+ bathrooms; price $1,500–$2,500; property type Condos (Entire Place). Only 1 condo in NYC matched: '2364 Mott Ave Unit Second floor', Far Rockaway, NY 11691 — 4 beds, 2 baths, 1,000 sq ft, $1,500/mo (Total Monthly Price, 12-month lease; Furnished, Hardwood Floors, Smoke Free). Note: the listing description states the individual private rooms are being rented (private room with en-suite bath $1,500/mo; private rooms with shared bath $1,000/mo), so it is a room-rental arrangement inside a condo unit rather than a whole 3-bedroom condo. Nearby 'closely matching' results (25) were all in New Jersey (Newark, Elizabeth, Jersey City), outside NYC. No sign-in, account, payment, or personal data was used."}

Verified on the profile page. **Dr. Sepehr Nassiripour, DDS** is explicitly a **Pediatric Dentistry** practitioner located at 414 N Camden Dr Ste 626, Beverly Hills, CA 90210 — which the results listing shows as **1.2 miles** from ZIP 90210 (well within 5 miles), rated 5.0/5 from 5 reviews.

I did not sign in, create an account, or enter any personal data; I dismissed the email-capture ("personalized match score") dialog rather than filling it.

